# v3 — ran in production 2026-09-23 04:29-13:43 UTC and was rolled back: at peak, GPU 0 had 380 MiB free and the
# image pre-processor (which runs on cuda:0 inside the HTTP/tokenizer process) failed 56 requests with
# OutOfMemoryError (docs/incidents.md #16). Kept for reference; deploy v3.1 instead.
# What it changed vs v2: graphs to 96, MTP capped at 3 steps (frees 6.6 GB/GPU of KDA verify snapshots),
# 700 KDA state slots, 4 decode rounds between prefill chunks.
MEMF=0.75
CHUNK=4096
CONTEXT_LENGTH=524288
CONC=96
MAXREQ=96
MAMBA_SLOTS=700
PDI=4
ADAPTIVE_SPEC=adaptive_spec_v3.json
SPEC_ARGS="--speculative-algorithm EAGLE --speculative-num-steps 3 --speculative-eagle-topk 1 --speculative-num-draft-tokens 4 --speculative-adaptive"
